  "id": "liquids___vapor_pressures",
  "title": "Liquids - Vapor Pressures",
  "description": "Vapor and saturation pressure for some common liquids. The vapor pressure of a liquid is defined as the pressure exerted by the molecules that escape from the liquid to form a separate vapor phase above the liquid surface.",
  "type": "calculator",
